---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Target, Heart, ShieldCheck, Sparkles } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com"
  description="Learn about FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com - our mission to provide a 100% free, watermark-free online matrimonial biodata maker for all Indian families."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'About Us', url: '/about' }]}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-12 space-y-8 sm:space-y-10 w-full max-w-full overflow-hidden">
    <div class="text-center space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-700 bg-rose-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase">
        OUR MISSION
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-2xl min-[360px]:text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-serif">
        About FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Empowering Indian families, brides, and grooms with 100% free, elegant, and private marriage biodatas without paywalls or hidden charges.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-md space-y-6 sm:space-y-8 text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2 font-serif">
          <Target class="w-5 h-5 text-rose-600" />
          <span>Why We Created This Platform</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Most marriage biodata websites on the internet claim to be "Free", but only after users spend 15 to 20 minutes meticulously filling in their personal family details and uploading photos do they hit a wall demanding ₹99 to ₹149 to download the PDF, or they slap large, unsightly watermarks across the document.
        </p>
        <p>
          We believe that marriage is an auspicious beginning of a sacred union between two families. No family should face paywalls or deception when creating their first impression. That is why <strong>FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com</strong> was created: a truly 100% free tool that will never charge you, never hide fees, and never deface your profile with watermarks.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2 font-serif">
          <ShieldCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600" />
          <span>100% On-Device Privacy (Client-Side Guarantee)</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Unlike other portals that store your sensitive contact numbers, addresses, and personal photographs on centralized databases—leaving you vulnerable to spam and data leaks—our builder runs 100% in your own web browser.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your photos and personal biodata details are processed on your own phone or computer and are never uploaded to any remote server. When you close or refresh your browser, that memory is completely cleared.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
